    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER FUN!</h2><br>Welcome to Party Shift, the online party game for 2 to 8 players! Get ready to laugh, cheer, and test your skills with our collection of exciting and unique minigames.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/6614916d8891d604319604be0f9de018.poster.avif?t=1747341357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/6614916d8891d604319604be0f9de018.webm?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/6614916d8891d604319604be0f9de018.mp4?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >30+ MINIGAMES</h2><br>In Party Shift, you and your friends will experience endless entertainment and plenty of absurdity. Our minigames are carefully crafted to provide a varied and challenging experience that will keep you coming back for more. Whether you're a seasoned gamer or just looking for some casual fun, Party Shift has something for everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/5364205009c72c92098f46cb8144f2ec.poster.avif?t=1747341357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/5364205009c72c92098f46cb8144f2ec.webm?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/5364205009c72c92098f46cb8144f2ec.mp4?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So grab your friends and get ready to party! With Party Shift, the fun never has to end. So, don't wait any longer and join the party now!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER FUN!</h2><br>Welcome to Party Shift, the online party game for 2 to 8 players! Get ready to laugh, cheer, and test your skills with our collection of exciting and unique minigames.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/6614916d8891d604319604be0f9de018.poster.avif?t=1747341357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/6614916d8891d604319604be0f9de018.webm?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/6614916d8891d604319604be0f9de018.mp4?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >30+ MINIGAMES</h2><br>In Party Shift, you and your friends will experience endless entertainment and plenty of absurdity. Our minigames are carefully crafted to provide a varied and challenging experience that will keep you coming back for more. Whether you're a seasoned gamer or just looking for some casual fun, Party Shift has something for everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/5364205009c72c92098f46cb8144f2ec.poster.avif?t=1747341357\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/5364205009c72c92098f46cb8144f2ec.webm?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2274190/extras/5364205009c72c92098f46cb8144f2ec.mp4?t=1747341357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So grab your friends and get ready to party! With Party Shift, the fun never has to end. So, don't wait any longer and join the party now!",
